{
  "$comment": "Mapping of provider item ids to catalog ids (packages/economy). Built on 25.11.2026 by joining the display names of poe.ninja's exchange items (league Standard, all types of economy.json) with the names of the catalog's currency, essence and omen base items; only exact, unique name matches are listed. 'orb-of-extraction' has two catalog items of that name; the one with the tag exchange_category:Incursion (the tradable one) is used, the bench variant has no exchange category. Not listed: provider entries without a catalog item of that name (runes, lineage support gems, uncut gems, idols, some fragments). The module checks every mapped id against the data release and reports the rest as unmapped. Re-run the join after a data release; ids that stop matching are reported, not guessed.",
